name showkerning
category Package
revision 63708
shortdesc Showing kerns in a document
longdesc The package displays all kerning values in the form of colored
longdesc bars directly at the respective position in the document.
longdesc Positive values are displayed in green, negative values in red.
longdesc The width of the bars corresponds exactly to the respective
longdesc kerning value. By option the bars can be placed behind or in
longdesc front of the glyphs. The package requires LuaLaTeX.
